  "description": "SCK Group is delighted to present this cosy 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment now available for rent!\n\n\n\nSituated in the secure, gated development of Bow Bridge House, this apartment offers the ideal city lifestyle in the heart of Kilmainham, surrounded by a wealth of local amenities.\n\n\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation is located on the second floor and includes an entrance hallway with storage, a modern bathroom, a comfortable double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, an open-plan living/dining area leading to a private balcony, and a semi integrated fully-fitted kitchen.\n\n\n\nPrime Location:\n\n•\tHeuston South Quarter, featuring shops like SuperValu, cafés, delis, and a pharmacy, is within walking distance.\n\n•\tSt. James’s Hospital is only a 5-minute walk away, as is access to the LUAS and several QBC bus routes.\n\n•\tMajor landmarks such as The Royal Kilmainham Hospital, the Irish Museum of Modern Art, Phoenix Park, Kilmainham Gaol, and Heuston Station are all easily accessible.\n\n•\tThe city centre is just a 15-minute walk away, and for motorists, there's easy access to the N4/M50 corridor.\n\n\n\nDon’t miss the opportunity to make this charming apartment your home!\n\n\n\n***E-mail enquiries only***\n\n\n\nDISCLAIMER: Due to the high volume of applications, we may not be able to respond to all inquiries. We wish you the best of luck in your property search.",
